CTRL + C
306. How do you perform CTRL+V?

Use:

actions.keyDown(Keys.CONTROL)
       .sendKeys("v")
       .keyUp(Keys.CONTROL)
       .perform();

Example:

WebElement textbox =
        driver.findElement(By.id("username"));

textbox.click();

Actions actions = new Actions(driver);

actions.keyDown(Keys.CONTROL)
       .sendKeys("v")
       .keyUp(Keys.CONTROL)
       .perform();
🔥 CTRL+A → CTRL+C → CTRL+V

You should know this practical sequence.

Actions actions = new Actions(driver);

actions.keyDown(Keys.CONTROL)
       .sendKeys("a")
       .keyUp(Keys.CONTROL)
       .perform();

actions.keyDown(Keys.CONTROL)
       .sendKeys("c")
       .keyUp(Keys.CONTROL)
       .perform();

actions.keyDown(Keys.CONTROL)
       .sendKeys("v")
